      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1010✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n第三場官方賽落幕囉~<br />\nG3官方賽的獎品上蓋可是金色版的邪神狂怒🤩<br />\n亮晶晶的唷✨✨<br />\n恭喜今日的前三名~<br />\n<br />\n本月份還有最後一場G3賽<br />\n報名的日期時間記得設鬧鐘囉😎<br />\n<br />\n#G3官方賽 #戰鬥陀螺 #海佃 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-cdg4-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/844140124_1548326863982251_7311768231252493001_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=111&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=hHBTd7knhHAQ7kNvwHigpBi&amp;_nc_oc=Adp_gJtpisNUoNIrqaDdp7mIBtPp2JzPSowtjGPrkugrKDYx7ZqIBOyAJKJDnOPuyho&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-3.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=CvsfBYNaRade3a9B-Vv3GA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJTubKPTFHVI6mVZjzL8AnNPnURRKEr2kfpPZgaSei8yy2CqQOCJtvaUeQkNS4_OWTUO7GRNeIz&amp;oh=00_AQPfXMibnfXANPNnQhu2Kv8DeCtSfEhP5hqVIubswYRMHA&amp;oe=6ACFFFCC\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-cdg4-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/842431289_1548327213982216_4665812190032950187_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=111&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=-YrnZyHhdGgQ7kNvwEB2Map&amp;_nc_oc=AdoB_WajR2TmetLczGjyZYoVj3i5tWqGY9M9YvLtgAenykCRmcrVaPzlcDn5YPlhs9k&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-3.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=CvsfBYNaRade3a9B-Vv3GA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKy52KbEf6V6E22j9T8UjHzD1xyGAjU_Jf7sPu5HuSjquHl9Er4c6u5R4aEN9EPERB19kcWWwiu&amp;oh=00_AQMLKdSvEzjO5d6OQIN9lVs6Wxsdq4pvutVKFnQWDKVPVg&amp;oe=6AD02565\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-cdg4-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/840579655_1548327220648882_7565033344078487036_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=102&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=ix8bbJjvdHkQ7kNvwGbdy19&amp;_nc_oc=AdpCnhNeHHp0Sd7Rl2QLseGE2thnsX5pdZS50ol5SbdPYpQsjJgTClqGpkrezRraDF0&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=CvsfBYNaRade3a9B-Vv3GA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKP_l8-C9J8zwD1eOQvG7NpSuqe7zbaDge39y_z6X1JSwKEwkbpWcB2BioCdHPliM_7Nzk7w