      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n萬聖特輯🎃海佃小點心🎃<br />\n<br />\n第二彈萬聖節小點心！<br />\n可口又可愛又搞怪👻👻<br />\n只有在海佃店才有的萬聖風格小餅乾～<br />\n<br />\n這個月小貝妹妹都會推出可愛的點心唷～<br />\n歡迎大家常來海佃娛樂區遊玩<br />\n就有機會碰上吃免費小點心的時間唷🥰<br />\n<br />\n#萬聖節 #點心 #台南 #安南區 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-cdg4-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/834982339_1542509777897293_1732434891402029231_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=yvXjztscs0gQ7kNvwGwoERr&amp;_nc_oc=Adr6vU6sNNv0NAP6dAH5KmRFJBla_kpthGNP_7tBKSSEQwhzYorbp-iTYazZL3vHltM&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=CvsfBYNaRade3a9B-Vv3GA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLFMbI0wehtFGrNf5U88cUxWJAC35zIf3rHkVET1BLsV5Sm9g7xeBquAcl3o0w1Bj2i7d75tOwj&amp;oh=00_AQNmjoaKNrXakulZZrKDzlPxp2ozHX6mXDhl7HBJvhZ7uw&amp;oe=6AD00117\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-cdg6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/833857413_1542509914563946_2029031908825469786_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=105&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=5f5meLjl7JoQ7kNvwGBg_HU&amp;_nc_oc=Adr2_AziFblULFcwZniruMbB41lZRsIF1DnLcSk8VlDhXWe2mcNwEM2iVKaSXMJsy2E&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg6-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=CvsfBYNaRade3a9B-Vv3GA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKWS7uxkh0Yy2ZL2_at-lPLDNNbIpXuG3vbLOT6ucp5N0JJp3ayeJyyyvKigZSmum5U-6pli5uK&amp;oh=00_AQOftelT5YrgBIAFsboupgVsajjTaFs4on8uVlue3lywyQ&amp;oe=6ACFF0E7\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-cdg4-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/833606484_1542509957897275_3452469332407045658_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=hqrXpkbM7FYQ7kNvwGE2Res&amp;_nc_oc=AdqMx_qSSjpozYPxWtWNJkmQiwCNEvJ_iya1p4wtsBH-6SUquitnrFvrjK_eO_6hFUo&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=CvsfBYNaRade3a9B-Vv3GA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKn5L9zOonWAURjGpV0F3pAWUzgR30WEwyMf2GJ9Mm3r2lOH4jt3xwxK5LZ6GRGevjCwplfT-vt&amp;oh=00_AQOLIBa